# Repo-root markers the fixture runner creates for the duration of a test run
# (D1-00): a fixture scan must stop at its own project, not walk into this
# repository. Removed on teardown; ignored so a crashed run leaves no noise.
tests/fixtures/*/*/project/.git/

# Belt and braces for the fixture plants (D1-10): the isolation tests now plant
# into temp copies, so nothing should ever appear here. If a killed run ever
# leaves one behind, an unrelated `git add -A` must not commit it.
tests/fixtures/*/*/.claude/
